  "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<title>\nPERiLS_2023 Field Catalog | NCAR EOL</title>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" name=\"viewport\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/ui-assets/application-fcbf0ed18d4571c976438d2a92ceee829a3a9bd8a0a1ec0bd11206a8ed43c069.css\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Poppins:400,500,600,700\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/ui-assets/projects/perils_2023-40a83e5dc61b33925b7ff50828dd45f53574a66270bc693449c02a2a8554debe.css\" />\n<script src=\"/ui-assets/application-0d828356e3cb80d53803eb1551a8b5472ef4e7cb2eba6ec4228772b1b267330f.js\"></script>\n\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"project-heading\">\n<div class=\"jumbotron\">\n<div class=\"container-fluid word-wrap\">\n<div class=\"row\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"project-heading\">\n<h1>\n<a href=\"/perils_2023\">\nPERiLS_2023 Field Catalog\n</a>\n</h1>\n<h2 class=\"visible-md visible-lg\">Propagation, Evolution and Rotation in Linear Storms 2023</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<nav class=\"navbar navbar-default\">\n<div id=\"navbar-container\">\n<div class=\"navbar-header\">\n<button class=\"navbar-toggle btn btn-default collapsed pull-left\" data-target=\"#project-navbar\" data-toggle=\"collapse\">\nPERiLS_2023 Menu\n</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"navbar-collapse collapse\" id=\"project-navbar\">\n<ul class=\"navbar-nav nav\">\n<li class=\"active\"><a href=\"/perils_2023\">Home</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/perils_2023/reports\">Reports</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/perils_2023/status\">Status</a></li>\n<li class=\"dropdown\"><a class=\"dropdown-toggle\" data-toggle=\"dropdown\" href=\"javascript:void(0);\" id=\"dropdown-menu-30\">\nProducts\n<b class=\"caret\"></b>\n</a>\n<ul aria-labelled-by=\"dropdown-menu-30\" class=\"dropdown-menu\" role=\"menu\">\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2023/advisory\">\nAdvisory\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2023/analysis\">\nAnalysis\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2023/lidar\">\nLidar\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2023/model\">\nModel\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2023/radar\">\nRadar\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2023/satellite\">\nSatellite\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2023/surface\">\nSurface\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2023/upperair\">\nUpper-Air\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"/perils_2023/missions\">Missions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/perils_2023/tools\">Tools &amp; Links</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://data.eol.ucar.edu/project/626/datasets?subprojectsIds=\" target=\"_blank\">Data Access <span class='glyphicon glyphicon-new-window'></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/perils_2023/help\">Help</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"contact-us\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-default\" href=\"mailto:catalog@eol.ucar.edu?subject=PERiLS_2023 Catalog\" role=\"button\">\n<span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-envelope\"></span>\nContact Us\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</nav>\n\n<div id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n<div class=\"visible-sm visible-md visible-lg\">\n<img src=\"/ui-assets/projects/perils2023_front-cb3445341d85acf974828b947ed93c2b1af8024a54ef8bf1c02e899f03105cee.jpg\" />\nUniversity of Illinois FARM COW radar imagery of the Quasi-Linear Convective System (QLCS) passing through the PERiLS_2023 multi-Doppler network during PERiLS_2023 IOP3 at 0106 UTC on 25 March 2023 with the signature of the verified tornado near Rolling Fork, MS. Photo courtesy Karen Kosiba.\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n<h3>Status</h3>\nThe PERiLS_2023 field campaign took place 8 February to 3 May 2023 over the southeastern United States. PERiLS had an extensive network of mobile and fixed instrumentation including radars, profiling systems, surface met stations, and lightning mapping array stations that provided observations examining quasi-linear convective system (QLCS) tornadogenesis over the southeastern United States region.\n<p></p>\n<b>\n<a href=\"perils_2023/missions\">PERiLS_2023 Mission Table:</a>\n</b>\nSummary of PERiLS_2023 operations and related products\n<p></p>\n<b>\n<a href=\"perils_2023/reports\">PERiLS_2023 Reports:</a>\n</b>\nList of reports related to project operations\n<p></p>\n<b></b>\n<p></p>\n<b></b>\n<b>\n<a href=\"https://data.eol.ucar.edu/project/626/datasets?subprojectsIds=\">Data Access:</a>\n</b>\nDatasets for this project can be found in the Long Term Data Archive at NCAR/EOL for PERiLS_2023\n<p></p>\n<b>\n<a href=\"http://www.eol.ucar.edu/field_projects/perils\">PERiLS_2023 Web Page at NCAR/EOL:</a>\n</b>\nAll other Data Management related questions\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer container-fluid\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-2 eol-logo\">\n<div class=\"visible-md visible-lg\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.eol.ucar.edu/\"><img alt=\"NCAR EOL\" width=\"125\" heigth=\"125\" src=\"/ui-assets/eol-small-logo-a5814375cfe46bc76385226c5d10d451e03f0d1855120c59beb77fed2a0248fc.png\" />\n</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-8\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3 link-container align-left vertical-line left\">\n<dl>\n<dd class=\"bold\">External Webpages</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"https://www.eol.ucar.edu/projects/perils\">EOL PERiLS</a>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"https://www.nssl.noaa.gov/projects/perils/\">NSSL PERiLS</a>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"https://www.eol.ucar.edu/\">EOL</a>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"https://www.eol.ucar.edu/content/project-management-office-pmo\">EOL/PMO</a>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"https://www.eol.ucar.edu/facilities/data-management-services\">EOL/DMS</a>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3 link-container align-left vertical-line left\">\n<dl>\n<dd class=\"bold\">Catalog Resources</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"/\">Field Catalogs</a>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"/perils_2023/help/user_guide\">Catalog Users Guide</a>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"/perils_2023/upload\">Upload Documents</a>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"mailto:catalog@eol.ucar.edu?subject=PERiLS_2023%20Catalog\">Contact Us</a>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3 link-container align-left vertical-line left\">\n<dl>\n<dd class=\"bold\">Social</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ncareol\">EOL Facebook</a>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-2 nsf-logo\">\n<div class=\"visible-md visible-lg\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.nsf.gov/\"><img alt=\"NSF\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" src=\"/ui-assets/nsf-logo-small-cc4c8b6e4d1c272e0aaafdbc0015041f7e1cf5415844eea643e5a9950339b598.png\" />\n</a><div class=\"ncar-ucar-logo\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.ucar.edu/\"><img alt=\"NCAR UCAR\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" src=\"/ui-assets/ncar-ucar-logo-small-2f8f4d6538c4801b67b14f0a855eb6da5db54952fca84becb5859bf645f409af.png\" />\n</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"align-center\">\n<p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.ucar.edu/terms-of-use\">&copy; 2026 UCAR. All Rights Reserved.\n</a></p>\n<p>\nMuch of the Material found on the Site is based upon work supported by\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.nsf.gov\"><strong>the National Science Foundation</strong>\n</a>.\n<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://ncar.ucar.edu\"><strong>The National Center for Atmospheric Research</strong>\n</a>is sponsored by\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.nsf.gov\"><strong>the National Science Foundation ('NSF')</strong>\n</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"
